OL,3,GNEWSADeaths of distressed pilot whales
OL,4,A'devastating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of two stranded pilot whales
OL,7,Fhas been described as "devastating" by
OL,8,Fa marine researcher.
OL,10,FBritish Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,11,F(BDMLR) was alerted to a pod of about
OL,12,F40 distressed whales near to the shore
OL,13,Fat Amble, Northumberland, at 15:00 BST
OL,14,Fon Sunday. Two of five stranded whales
OL,15,Fwere confirmed to have died.
OL,17,FThe BDMLR said it was not the same pod
OL,18,Fof whales herded out of the River
OL,19,FThames at the weekend as the distance
OL,20,Fbetween locations was further than the
OL,21,Fspecies could swim in 24 hours.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
